{"text": "The next morning, the little boy put the soldier on the windowsill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the window flew open, and the soldier fell from the third floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody knows if it was the wind or the goblin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The maid and the little boy went down to look for him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He did not shout, because he was a soldier in uniform. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then it began to rain harder and harder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the rain, two street boys found the soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They made a boat out of newspaper and put him in it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boat floated down the gutter and into a long, dark tunnel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A big water rat jumped out and shouted, Show me your passport. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the soldier said nothing and held his gun more tightly.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "x", "t", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", "s", "i", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "h", "i", "r", "d", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", "s", " ", "i", "f", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", 